offer_lines = Array[String](["Those sprinklers holding up? Good. Four tiles, though. I can do better.", "Wider pipes, a stronger spinner, and a frame that won't rot. It'll water all eight tiles round it.", "Forty timber and 600 gold. Bring them and the first big one's yours."])
